  Slug: school-of-rooted-wisdom
  DisplayName: School of Rooted Wisdom
  IconPath: icons/magic/nature/tree-spirit-glow-black-yellow.webp
  Description: "You've studied at the Magaambya or under one of its traveling professors,
    learning the ancient magic of Golarion's oldest academy. Your curriculum is self-directed,
    allowing you to choose a branch of study and personalize your learning. If you
    choose the School of Rooted Wisdom, you gain the below curriculum and school
    spells. Curriculum cantrips: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Detect Magic]
    1st: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Alarm] 2nd: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Dispel
    Magic] 3rd: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Safe Passage] 4th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Mountain
    Resilience] 5th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Control Water] 6th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Truesight]
    7th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Energy Aegis] 8th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Quandary]
    9th: \u2014 School Spells initial: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Halcyon
    Mists]; advanced: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Call the Ten] This is
    your primary trunk of study, to which you add one of the following five secondary
    branches, granting you additional curriculum spells. @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Cascade
    Bearers] @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Emerald Boughs] @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Rain-Scribes]
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Tempest-Sun Mages] @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Uzunjati]"
  SourceTitle: Pathfinder Lost Omens Rival Academies
